  "title": "Rule 16 跨期驗證：VIX-Zone Enhanced HVT PASS",
  "description": "## VIX-Zone Enhanced HVT：Rule 16 跨期驗證\n\n### 驗證目的\nVIX-Zone Enhanced HVT 在原始測試中顯示 +0.090 Sharpe 改善。\n依 Rule 16，需在 3 個不同時期驗證，若無法全部勝出則判定為過擬合。\n\n### 策略規格\n- **Standard HVT**: GJR-GARCH w=2000, VIX/GARCH > 1.3 切換, 目標波動率 10%\n- **VIX-Zone Enhanced**: 同上 + VIX < 14.0 加碼 30%, VIX 14.0-18.0 減碼 20%\n\n### 跨期比較\n\n| 時期 | Standard Sharpe | Enhanced Sharpe | Delta | Winner | Avg VIX |\n|------|----------------|-----------------|-------|--------|---------|\n| 2014-2018 (pre-COVID) | 0.762 | 1.243 | +0.482 | Enhanced | 14.9 |\n| 2019-2022 (COVID + rate hike) | 0.938 | 0.955 | +0.017 | Enhanced | 22.5 |\n| 2023-2026 (recovery + Iran) | 1.588 | 1.674 | +0.086 | Enhanced | 17.3 |\n\n**平均 Delta Sharpe: +0.195**\n**Enhanced 勝出: 3/3 時期**\n\n### 詳細指標\n\n| 時期 | 策略 | Sharpe | 年化報酬 | 年化波動 | MaxDD | Calmar | Sortino |\n|------|------|--------|----------|----------|-------|--------|---------|\n| 2014-2018 (pre-COVID) | Standard | 0.762 | 10.27% | 7.58% | -9.15% | 1.12 | 1.24 |\n| 2014-2018 (pre-COVID) | Enhanced | 1.243 | 15.00% | 8.02% | -9.49% | 1.58 | 2.18 |\n| 2019-2022 (COVID + rate hike) | Standard | 0.938 | 11.83% | 7.66% | -8.16% | 1.45 | 1.54 |\n| 2019-2022 (COVID + rate hike) | Enhanced | 0.955 | 11.90% | 7.59% | -8.09% | 1.47 | 1.56 |\n| 2023-2026 (recovery + Iran) | Standard | 1.588 | 17.69% | 7.74% | -7.53% | 2.35 | 2.89 |\n| 2023-2026 (recovery + Iran) | Enhanced | 1.674 | 18.20% | 7.60% | -7.67% | 2.37 | 3.02 |\n\n### VIX 區間分佈\n\n| 時期 | VIX<14 | VIX 14-18 | VIX>=18 | Avg VIX |\n|------|--------|-----------|---------|---------|\n| 2014-2018 (pre-COVID) | 53.4% | 27.8% | 18.8% | 14.9 |\n| 2019-2022 (COVID + rate hike) | 10.9% | 24.1% | 65.0% | 22.5 |\n| 2023-2026 (recovery + Iran) | 20.8% | 45.7% | 33.5% | 17.3 |\n\n### 判定\n\n**PASS: VIX-Zone Enhancement 是真實改善**\n\nEnhancement 在所有 3 個不同市場環境中均提升 Sharpe，機制穩健。\n",
